(property "Source_changes" "Codex adapts BRK8305 A03 USB symbol for GCT USB4110-GF-A. All16 A/B and4 shell pin identities and existing wiring retained. KiCad10 USB4110 footprint copied locally; four SH SMT pads renamed M1-M4. GCT drawing USB4110 revB4,22May2024,sheet1/2. Same X/Y footprint origin/body-front edge; mating height1.68mm versus priorUSB4105 1.73mm. 3D uses inherited datasheet-derived shell envelope, not manufacturer CAD; no USB4105 PTH legs. Assembly/mechanical/USB qualification pending." (at 0.0000 0.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
